24. STRONGER PRODUCTION IMPLEMENTATION
======================================================================

A production implementation should not depend only on:

overall_score > threshold


Instead, both overall and individual high-risk scores can be checked.


Example:

def should_trigger_alert(drift, overall_threshold=40):

    scores = drift["drift_scores"]

    return (
        drift["overall_drift_score"] > overall_threshold
        or scores["hallucination"] > 70
        or scores["quality_drift"] > 70
        or scores["topic_drift"] > 70
    )


Example Problem:

Topic Drift        = 10
Tone Drift         = 8
Quality Drift      = 15
Hallucination      = 85

Overall Average    = 29.5


If only the overall threshold of 40 were checked:

29.5 < 40

The response might incorrectly pass.

However:

Hallucination = 85

The individual hallucination threshold catches the issue.


